# Gym Finder Riyadh – Stage 2 Project Charter

## Project Objectives
**Purpose:** Help users choose gyms in Riyadh easily by providing clear info on facilities, equipment, and amenities.  
**SMART Objectives:**  
- **MVP:** Web-based platform with gym search by name/equipment and detailed profiles.  
- **Usability:** ≥85% user satisfaction in trials.  
- **Coverage:** Onboard ≥10 gyms in Riyadh.  
- **Data Accuracy:** ≥90% verified info.  
- **Scalability:** Plan for mobile app and expansion.

## Stakeholders & Team Roles
**External Stakeholders:** Gym-goers, gym owners/managers, fitness chains, advertisers.  
**Team Roles:**  
- **Bushra Alshulail:** Back-End Developer  
- **Nada Alshuraidah:** Front-End Developer  
- **Munira Alsubaie:** Database/Admin  
- **Shouq Alosaimi:** API Developer  

**Responsibilities:**  
- **Front-End:** UI/UX design, responsive interface  
- **Back-End:** Server-side logic, database  
- **API:** Connect front-end and back-end  
- **Database/Admin:** Collect, verify, update gym data  

## Project Scope
**In-Scope:** Web platform, search gyms by name/equipment, gym profiles, admin panel, Riyadh gyms only.  
**Out-of-Scope:** Mobile app, other cities, memberships, reviews, bookings, ads.

## Risks & Mitigation
- **Data Accuracy:** Regular admin checks  
- **Gym Participation:** Start with public info; offer incentives  
- **Scalability:** Build scalable architecture  
- **User Adoption:** Highlight unique features, simple interface  
- **Competition:** Focus on local accuracy and brand  
- **Mobile Expectation:** Responsive web, communicate roadmap

## High-Level Plan
1. **MVP Development:** Web interface, database, search, profiles, admin panel  
2. **Testing & Feedback:** User trials, gather usability feedback  
3. **Data Onboarding & Refinement:** Add gyms, verify info, optimize UI  
4. **Scalability Planning:** Prepare for expansion and future mobile app

